# The registry zip ships every git-tracked file; `includes` in pyproject.toml
# only force-includes over these patterns. Ship the node payload and docs,
# nothing else: the registry scanner reads every file in the zip, and the dev
# tooling below (process-killer scripts, aiohttp test harnesses, HF URLs in
# workflow notes) trips it.
tests/
tools/
scripts/
docs/
test_data/
.cursor/
.cursorrules
comfyui_workflows/
*.sh
install.py
create_node_files.py
rocm_nodes.py
pytest.ini
uv.lock
example_workflow.json
example_workflow_wan_video.json
flux_dev_optimized.json
NEXT_STEPS.md
REFACTORING_SUMMARY.md
ARCHITECTURE.md
RULES.md
Benchmarks.md
CHANGELOG.md
INSTALL.md
